              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="project-content">
              <span class="project-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <h3 class="project-title">The Shadow</h3>
              <p class="project-summary">Personal command center for tasks, library of 378 saved links, guides, videos and X posts.</p>
